    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "                 Game Rules\n\nMove your ball around the level using WASD,
    and hit Space whenever you need to jump over gaps or obstacles. Scattered across
    the map are coins \u2014 roll into them to collect each one, and you'll hear
    a little chime and see your coin counter go up every time. Keep exploring until
    you've grabbed every single coin on the level; once the last one disappears,
    a \"Victory!\" message will pop up on screen to let you know you've won.\n\nBefore
    jumping in, check out the Settings menu from the main screen if you want to toggle
    fullscreen mode or turn the background music on or off. When you're ready, hit
    Start to drop into the level, or Quit if you're done playing for now.\n\nGravity
    is on, so don't worry about your ball floating off into space \u2014 it'll always
    come back down. If you're feeling fast, tune your speed and jump height, since
    both react instantly and can make navigating trickier (or easier) sections feel
    completely different."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
